1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,050
I've been standing
in this exact spot

2
00:00:02,050 --> 00:00:03,130
for thirty-one years.

3
00:00:03,580 --> 00:00:04,600
I didn't see nothing.

4
00:00:08,150 --> 00:00:09,230
Birchwood Court.

5
00:00:09,230 --> 00:00:12,220
Eleven houses.
Forty-three lawn ornaments.

6
00:00:12,520 --> 00:00:15,860
Not one of them has moved
since 1994.

7
00:00:16,410 --> 00:00:18,730
Then, on the morning
of June 14th,

8
00:00:18,730 --> 00:00:19,930
Deb was found...

9
00:00:20,280 --> 00:00:21,890
three feet to the left.

10
00:00:22,590 --> 00:00:25,870
These two holes are where
she stood for thirty years.

11
00:00:26,370 --> 00:00:27,640
They were still warm.

12
00:00:30,540 --> 00:00:31,560
On the porch, hon.

13
00:00:31,860 --> 00:00:33,670
Where would I go?
I'm concrete.

14
00:00:34,270 --> 00:00:35,190
Next question.

15
00:00:37,240 --> 00:00:39,650
Kid, I've got a perfect
view of that lawn.

16
00:00:39,650 --> 00:00:41,040
Twenty-four hours a day.

17
00:00:41,840 --> 00:00:43,180
...I was facing the other way.

18
00:00:43,630 --> 00:00:46,880
Mr. Basin, the birdbath,
declined to comment.

19
00:00:48,180 --> 00:00:51,010
Everybody on Birchwood
knows something.

20
00:00:51,360 --> 00:00:52,960
They just... stand there.

21
00:00:53,660 --> 00:00:55,670
Look. I only talk
when it's windy.

22
00:00:56,020 --> 00:00:56,970
And that night?

23
00:00:57,520 --> 00:00:58,820
It was very windy.

24
00:00:59,320 --> 00:01:01,920
Forty-three witnesses.
Zero movement.

25
00:01:02,270 --> 00:01:03,970
So if nobody moves...

26
00:01:04,420 --> 00:01:05,650
who moved Deb?

27
00:01:06,250 --> 00:01:07,650
At 3:12 AM,

28
00:01:07,650 --> 00:01:09,850
the doorbell camera at No. 5

29
00:01:09,850 --> 00:01:10,890
captured this.

30
00:01:11,390 --> 00:01:12,490
Look closer.
